<title>USA: Ict Group Q3 pro forma $0.03 vs $0.03.</title>
<headline>Ict Group Q3 pro forma $0.03 vs $0.03.</headline>
<dateline>LANGHORNE, Pa. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICT Group Inc.</p>
<p>consolidated condensed statements of income (unaudited)</p>
<p>			 (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			     Three Months Ended   Nine Months Ended</p>
